INSERT INTO claims SELECT printf('CL%04d',34+rowid),printf('CN%04d',id),'废水：'||stream,process||coalesce('；'||dest,''),(SELECT grade FROM bs WHERE n=src),printf('W03S%02d',src),stage||'；'||note,'2026-11-27' FROM bw;
INSERT INTO claims SELECT printf('CL%04d',34+(SELECT count(*) FROM bw)+rowid),printf('CN%04d',id),'产能：'||product,printf('%g',value)||unit,(SELECT grade FROM bs WHERE n=src),printf('W03S%02d',src),basis||'；'||note,'2026-11-27' FROM bc;
INSERT INTO tasks SELECT printf('T%04d',id),printf('CN%04d',id),'P1',missing,name||' 环评 验收 排污许可 废水','待核实' FROM bt WHERE id>=199;
